le=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unavail</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>IS</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IS}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是曝光份额、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>GMVS</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GMVS}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMVS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 GMV 份额、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>unavail</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{unavail}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unavail</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不可售占比、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。这个分数的用途是<strong>排序与分桶</strong>（找出最值得人工介入的 N 个商品），不是精确度量——权重取值只需保证单调性与可解释性，不必追求最优。它的最大价值在于把「不可售」作为减项显式纳入：一个各方面都健康但在某市场不可售的商品，健康分应该低，因为它的所有曝光都是浪费。</p>\n<p>健康分必须做<strong>变化归因</strong>才能用于运营：分数下降时给出主导项（是 CTR 掉了还是曝光份额掉了），否则运营看到降分仍然不知道做什么。这与本章第一步的「找第一个断点」是同一逻辑，只是从单商品扩展到商品集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>商品在搜索里的表现拆成四项能力：可被召回、被看见、被选择、被成交；诊断方法是从后往前找<strong>第一个断点</strong>，断点之后的指标都是后果。</li>\n<li>诊断进入门槛用泊松噪声判断，避免为随机波动做优化；诊断最后一步必须排除季节性、自身运营动作与平台级变化。</li>\n<li>跨境有四类可售性失配（地域、价格、语言、合规），它们表现为商品问题但修复不在商品侧，必须在诊断中先排除。</li>\n<li>基线必须分层（市场 × 类目 × 价格带 × 新老），商品健康分用于批量筛查与分桶，其价值在排序而非精确度量。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P[商品候选] --&gt; F1[过滤 不可售与准入]&#10;    F1 --&gt; F2[分层基线 市场×类目×价格带]&#10;    F2 --&gt; S[健康分计算]&#10;    S --&gt; S1[曝光份额项]&#10;    S --&gt; S2[位置校正CTR项]&#10;    S --&gt; S3[CVR项]&#10;    S --&gt; S4[不可售减项]&#10;    S1 --&gt; R[分桶排序]&#10;    S2 --&gt; R&#10;    S3 --&gt; R&#10;    S4 --&gt; R&#10;    R --&gt; A1[人工诊断队列 topN]&#10;    R --&gt; A2[自动建议清单]\">graph TD\n    P[商品候选] --&gt; F1[过滤 不可售与准入]\n    F1 --&gt; F2[分层基线 市场×类目×价格带]\n    F2 --&gt; S[健康分计算]\n    S --&gt; S1[曝光份额项]\n    S --&gt; S2[位置校正CTR项]\n    S --&gt; S3[CVR项]\n    S --&gt; S4[不可售减项]\n    S1 --&gt; R[分桶排序]\n    S2 --&gt; R\n    S3 --&gt; R\n    S4 --&gt; R\n    R --&gt; A1[人工诊断队列 topN]\n    R --&gt; A2[自动建议清单]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品搜索表现与可售诊断","id":"商品搜索表现与可售诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：商品在搜索里的四项能力","id":"核心概念-商品在搜索里的四项能力"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断序列：四步定位法","id":"诊断序列-四步定位法"},{"level":2,"text":"可售性诊断：跨境特有的四类失配","id":"可售性诊断-跨境特有的四类失配"},{"level":2,"text":"分层基线与商品健康分","id":"分层基线与商品健康分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"查询需求/缺口/趋势分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/query-product-insights/query-demand-analysis"},"next":{"title":"分市场/语言对比看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/query-product-insights/per-market-compare"}}